{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11107030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11107030","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110703001:1":{"text":"Brutus... Do you honestly think you'd lose to Alsa and me in a fair fight right now?","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人。您认为此时此刻，在一场公平的决斗中，您会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF76180E9FA6F6B4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110703002:1":{"text":"I've never considered it in that way. You are both forces to be reckoned with at your age.","source_cn":"我从未那么想过。索恩，阿尔萨，你们是你们这个年纪的强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4F7C6F2FCBB041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110703003:1":{"text":"But perfecting your battle instincts takes time. Experience is essential, it cannot be accomplished overnight.","source_cn":"但若想锤炼最完美的战斗直觉，经验必不可少，这绝非一朝一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3632331FAB21D77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110703004:1":{"text":"We agree. We understand that winning this festival might be a bit too heavy a burden for us right now.","source_cn":"我们也是这么想的。战歌节胜者这一称号，对现在的我们来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A95145AEF346EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110703005:1":{"text":"Yeah, even though we've secretly dreamed of it... But deep down, in everyone's hearts...","source_cn":"没错，虽然我们是有偷偷幻想过啦……但在我心中、在索恩心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EE809B19EA516BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110703006:1":{"text":"Brutus is the true champion. The desert's mightiest warrior!","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人，您才是当之无愧的胜者，是这片沙漠最强的战神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A61FED3F36D8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110703007:1":{"text":"... Until the next Warsong Festival.","source_cn":"……直到下下一届战歌节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B6D40D4735501E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1110703007":{"text":"... Until the next Warsong Festival.","source_cn":"……直到下下一届战歌节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8B6D40D4735501E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110703008:1":{"text":"Well, I believe Brutus should know my true thoughts.","source_cn":"我想了想，还是希望布鲁特斯大人知道我的想法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC809434C5EB5BFCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110703009:1":{"text":"Alright, Soren and Alsa.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！好！索恩，阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CA28AF9D6DF794","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110703010:1":{"text":"I'll hold onto first place until you're ready to take it from me!","source_cn":"我会替你们保留着战神之名，直到你们强到足够挑战我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345A5A94C8DE1BEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110703011:1":{"text":"That day will come sooner than you think!","source_cn":"会有那一天的。或许比您想得快。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE5EA7601815047B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110703012:1":{"text":"And remember when you asked us about our goals for joining the Warsong Festival? Well, we've achieved them now!","source_cn":"而且，您曾经问我和索恩参加战歌节的目的对吧？现在，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44F3A379FD8D57D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110703013:1":{"text":"That's right! The Uru Clan's name echoes across every corner of the desert now!","source_cn":"没错！现在，乌尔氏族的名声已经传遍了沙漠的每个角落！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70DBEABDC56E0212","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110703014:1":{"text":"Whether they're Mikola's friends or folks who couldn't give a hoot about the festival, everyone's now buzzing about these two young warriors.","source_cn":"无论是不是曼卡拉的老朋友，甚至最不关心战歌节的人，也都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E9A9697F2CB468","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110703015:1":{"text":"Yesterday, they were nobodies, but today, they're heroes! Even the gods must love a tale like this, right?","source_cn":"昨日还是无名之辈，现在却成了英雄！恐怕连神都爱看这样的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1217D1D40BA21272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110703016:1":{"text":"Fair enough. Well then... Take care, you two. I've got some business to attend to, so I'll take my leave.","source_cn":"如此便好。那么……保重，索恩，阿尔萨。我有些事要处理，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0545C68FD823439A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110703017:1":{"text":"Goodbye, Brutus! And please, visit our clan when you have the chance!","source_cn":"保重，布鲁特斯大人！有机会请一定来我们氏族坐坐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF2FAF577219F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110703018:1":{"text":"Alsa, what are you spacing out for?","source_cn":"阿尔萨……喂，好端端地发什么愣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BE4617BA9A2333C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110703019:1":{"text":"Huh? Oh... It's kind of embarrassing, but just now, Brutus reminded me of Pops...","source_cn":"啊？哦……说来有点害臊，刚才布鲁特斯大人的样子，让我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE2CA879BF74C4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110703020:1":{"text":"What was he like?","source_cn":"那是个怎样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A313E6AC53D465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110703021:1":{"text":"Don't get the wrong idea! Our dad was just an average Mauler. You could've taken him out in three moves. I could probably even beat him as I am now.","source_cn":"您别误会！我们的老爹是个普通得不能再普通的蛮血。在您手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x522BA4E4AC4B598A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110703022:1":{"text":"But he was... the best person in the world. Soren, let's get back. I can't wait to share the news with Pops!","source_cn":"他只是……世界上最好的人，仅此而已。索恩，我们快点回去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x072815F6ACBA1920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110703023:1":{"text":"Yes... Me too.","source_cn":"嗯……我也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A9FBF559F437A69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Was that necessary?","source_cn":"……还是说实话了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26BC4AD992DD605D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Was that necessary?","female":"Was that necessary?","variant_male_record_index":"63184","variant_female_record_index":"63185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"You never hold anything back.","source_cn":"有必要说这句吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x74F9DC1BAC61389A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You never hold anything back.","female":"You never hold anything back.","variant_male_record_index":"63186","variant_female_record_index":"63187","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"Brutus","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"Mikola","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":26,"speaker_count":4}}